\subsection{DNA Packaging and Segment Boundaries}

Eukaryotic DNA is packaged into nucleosomes, each consisting of DNA wound around a core of eight histone proteins (Figure \ref{fig:chromatin_structure}). This tightly wound form is called heterochromatin, while the open form is called euchromatin.

